`s 530.1(c) any witness may give evidence in either official language` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `an order is granted under section 530` THEN NOTHING   -- GRANT-GATE: if -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If an order is granted under section 530"
        IF NOT (`the stage of the proceedings` EQUALS `preliminary inquiry` OR `the stage of the proceedings` EQUALS `trial`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "during the preliminary inquiry or trial"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

