-- (g) the record of proceedings during the preliminary inquiry or trial shall include (i) a transcript of everything that was said in the official language in which it was said,
-- (ii) a transcript of any interpretation into the other official language, and (iii) any documentary evidence tendered, in the official language in which it was tendered.
